## Now (01:40)

**1. Write tool, two files in parallel** (files avoid zsh quoting problems and give both advisors identical text)

`/tmp/b8-wgka.txt`:
```
Your timeout question is now ballot B8 with the two advisors; expect the result in about 25 minutes. Do not wait for it.
1. Continue plan step 6 and the following steps now, under superpowers:test-driven-development.
2. Use your own recommendation, proxy_read_timeout 5s, as a PROVISIONAL value: one line in the template, one assertion in the tests.
